// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Node: Intent Normalizer & Weighting Engine   Mode: Run Once for All Items
// Converts provider-native records into one 0–100 score per source and
// account (domain), before decay:
//   Bombora  composite score per topic; only topics ≥ BOMBORA_SURGE_THRESHOLD
